##	Sub agent queries

I'd like a new sheet in this folder compiling all the real world reference materials I can read up on to educate myself on. Please sort them by order of relevance to the story, by how much context is borrowed or how meaningful the reference is. Keep the pointers narrow for me to look up. For example, the Lament for Lleucu Llwyd is short and insightful as to one of the character's core concept. Good link for me to read up on. By contrast, the Mabinogi as a whole isn't meaningful reading to understand the Cyfarwydd, unless it's pointed at a preface or an external snippet describing the cultural history of these storytellers and their inspirations. You may procure web links as recommended reading where applicable. Not every reference needs these, as they can be a big time sink for marginal results.

